- op: discuss  # 6495
  at: '2026-04-09T06:53:05Z'  # 6495
  by: agent  # 6495
  actor: jgstern_agent  # 6495
  clock: 8  # 6495
  nonce: '6495'  # 6495
  message: "Fixed in PR #2821. auto-pr list/status now reconcile the vPR queue against origin/<base> via git merge-base --is-ancestor. Stale entries (commit already merged) are annotated in list output, and status reports (N live, M stale) or 'ALL appear stale'. New 'auto-pr prune' subcommand removes stale entries and prints an audit trail. 9 new tests in test_autopr_result_sentinel.py covering list/status/prune against clean, mixed, and all-stale queues. Pairs with WI-miriz (sentinel) and WI-bahuf (rejection hint): the three items together cover all observation points for silent-success-blip detection — exit time, next push time, queue inspection time."  # 6495
